{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Dark Cowboy Hat is a ",["l","帽子","hat"]," that can be obtained from ",["l","骷髅洞穴#Treasure Rooms","treasure rooms"]," in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," (≈3.85% chance). It can also rarely be found in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," as a ",["l","矿井#Special Items","special item"],", from special monster drops or crates and barrels, during the ",["l","任务#Danger In The Deep","'Danger In The Deep'"]," quest or after activating the ",["l","矿井#Shrine of Challenge","Shrine of Challenge"],"."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Introduced."]]]]]]]}